bic_trace_step.reason:
The function `irdma_destroy_qp` unconditionally calls `wait_for_completion(&iwqp->free_qp)` on lines 434-435: 

c
	irdma_qp_rem_ref(&iwqp->ibqp);
	wait_for_completion(&iwqp->free_qp);


This wait occurs regardless of whether a device reset is in progress (the reset flag `iwdev->reset` is only checked on line 437 before calling `irdma_cqp_qp_destroy_cmd`). This creates the circular dependency and deadlock during device reset described in the vulnerability root cause.
